        "cooked": "<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/editors-note-84\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/editors-note-84\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">theletterspage.libsyn.com</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/c/ca864864fd4764e914bcab3670be2db68d1c0662.jpeg\" class=\"thumbnail onebox-avatar\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\">\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/editors-note-84\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">The Letters Page: Editor's Note #84</a></h3>\n\n  <p>So many things to talk about! Show Notes: Run Time: 1:37:41 We cover a bunch of topics before even getting to the schedule! Including these yarn fellas! OmKnitron-X:  The Savage Hook-a:  FaKnitic:  Updates on Crochet-Ranger:  And then, we get to the...</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n\n<p>Upcoming schedule:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Tuesday, November 5th: Episode <span class=\"hashtag\">#299</span> - Writers’ Room: Rambler vs Biomancer</li>\n<li>Tuesday, November 12th: Episode <span class=\"hashtag\">#300</span> - Writers’ Room: Villains during OblivAeon (Justice Comics <span class=\"hashtag\">#738</span>)</li>\n<li>Tuesday, November 19th: Editor’s Note <span class=\"hashtag\">#85</span>\n</li>\n<li>Tuesday, November 26th: Episode <span class=\"hashtag\">#301</span> - Writers’ Room: Who is Deathfiend?</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Expected recording schedule:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Friday, November 1st: Episode <span class=\"hashtag\">#299</span> - Writers’ Room: Rambler vs Biomancer</li>\n<li>Friday, November 8th: Episode <span class=\"hashtag\">#300</span> - Writers’ Room: Villains during OblivAeon (Justice Comics <span class=\"hashtag\">#738</span>)</li>\n<li>Friday, November 15th: Editor’s Note <span class=\"hashtag\">#85</span>\n</li>\n<li>Friday, November 22nd: Episode <span class=\"hashtag\">#301</span> - Writers’ Room: Who is Deathfiend?</li>\n</ul>\n<p>More knitted Sentinels images:<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/9/9019f558b34fd6913b02fd679a752990c61c54f2.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/9019f558b34fd6913b02fd679a752990c61c54f2\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/9/9019f558b34fd6913b02fd679a752990c61c54f2_2_375x500.jpeg\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"kyMn1nIAN3ehMwK7JbfpGYNfpHc\" width=\"375\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/9/9019f558b34fd6913b02fd679a752990c61c54f2_2_375x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/9/9019f558b34fd6913b02fd679a752990c61c54f2_2_562x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/9/9019f558b34fd6913b02fd679a752990c61c54f2_2_750x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/9/9019f558b34fd6913b02fd679a752990c61c54f2_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1920×2560 592 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div><br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/0/08c1bf7026669da5e81fdc091180538256bac944.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/08c1bf7026669da5e81fdc091180538256bac944\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/