        "raw": "https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/editors-note-84\n\nUpcoming schedule:\n\n* Tuesday, November 5th: Episode #299 - Writers’ Room: Rambler vs Biomancer\n* Tuesday, November 12th: Episode #300 - Writers’ Room: Villains during OblivAeon (Justice Comics #738)\n* Tuesday, November 19th: Editor’s Note #85\n* Tuesday, November 26th: Episode #301 - Writers’ Room: Who is Deathfiend?\n\n\nExpected recording schedule:\n\n* Friday, November 1st: Episode #299 - Writers’ Room: Rambler vs Biomancer\n* Friday, November 8th: Episode #300 - Writers’ Room: Villains during OblivAeon (Justice Comics #738)\n* Friday, November 15th: Editor’s Note #85\n* Friday, November 22nd: Episode #301 - Writers’ Room: Who is Deathfiend?\n\nMore knitted Sentinels images:\n![image|375x500](upload://kyMn1nIAN3ehMwK7JbfpGYNfpHc.jpeg)\n![image|375x500](upload://1fsVcaGujSxewbSpsIo6zm11XlW.jpeg)\n![image|375x500](upload://zdvE79qCLWl5L79mGI0eQMjpCJg.jpeg)\n![image|500x500](upload://d1MB3b17B5QzIGitM7EzRPX2emF.jpeg)",
