        "created_at": "2024-10-22T15:52:22.075Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Oh wow, that beep is way louder on the recording than it was live. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/open_mouth.png?v=12\" title=\":open_mouth:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":open_mouth:\"></p>\n<p>Imagine living somewhere it rarely gets below 0F. :B</p>\n<p>Ah dang, he didn’t put Night Snake in the show notes! D: Oh well, can’t complain too much when the yarniverse pics are there.</p>\n<p>I am unreasonably excited about Deathfiend. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/eyes.png?v=12\" title=\":eyes:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":eyes:\"> Knowing nothing about them, I’ve already been trying to turn them into the newest blorbo.</p>\n<p>Asked about the pillar/column distinction, I would have actually gotten it perfectly backwards! Though now in hindsight, I wonder why… <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/thinking.png?v=12\" title=\":thinking:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":thinking:\"></p>\n<p>As of listening to this, they’re less than $500 away from fully funded on SOTM 2. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=12\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\"></p>\n<p>The newest villain from Sentinels of the Multiverse: Big Robot! <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/open_mouth.png?v=12\" title=\":open_mouth:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":open_mouth:\"></p>\n<p>Oh, the musical sting for Movie Knight’s letter! <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=12\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\"> How unexpected!</p>\n<p>Also bleeping out hell XD</p>",
