        "raw": "Oh wow, that beep is way louder on the recording than it was live. :O\n\nImagine living somewhere it rarely gets below 0F. :B\n\nAh dang, he didn't put Night Snake in the show notes! D: Oh well, can't complain too much when the yarniverse pics are there.\n\nI am unreasonably excited about Deathfiend. :eyes: Knowing nothing about them, I've already been trying to turn them into the newest blorbo.\n\nAsked about the pillar/column distinction, I would have actually gotten it perfectly backwards! Though now in hindsight, I wonder why... :thinking:\n\nAs of listening to this, they're less than $500 away from fully funded on SOTM 2. :D\n\nThe newest villain from Sentinels of the Multiverse: Big Robot! :O\n\nOh, the musical sting for Movie Knight's letter! :D How unexpected!\n\nAlso bleeping out hell XD",
