        "username": "Sea-Envy",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/sea-envy/{size}/1849_2.png",
        "created_at": "2024-10-26T23:29:13.839Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Mark Benedetto is a costumed supervillain?! that’s as silly as that hoax a few years back trying to say Mia Montgomery was The Wraith.</p>\n<p>I read a story one time (possibly the short story anthology for Silver Age Sentinels RPG) that heroes and villains are so busy playing their own secret ID games that they overlook other people’s dumb excuses</p>\n<p>If I remember there is card art of Mark and Mia together at a party and I am 100% sure that anytime her secret is revealed he never believes it since he knows her (thinks he knows her from brief casual social interaction)<br>\nShe might also think he is too incompetent to be as successful as Revenant is.</p>",
